GAPS: Direct 2022 primary evidence on Putin's day-to-day operational control remains thinner than the public rhetoric and macro-policy record; attribution for stabilization is partly indirect because the Bank of Russia and Finance Ministry owned much of the response; more Russian-language decrees, budget-execution records, and command/personnel-shift documentation would improve 8B.8-8B.10. NEXT_QUERIES: `Путин мобилизация 2022 замена командования`, `Путин бюджетные правила 2022 указ`, `Путин выступление бизнес 24 февраля 2022`, `ЦБ РФ пресс-релизы 2022 ключевая ставка`, `Кремль 2022 военная промышленность`, `Россия 2022 Istanbul talks Kremlin statement`
